│ █ NAVIGATION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
│ █
│ │ ← →        Move through the nine pages in a fixed cycle that wraps, from
│ │            Main to Help and back to Main. The footer shows the page's
│ │            place, such as 2/9 Cores.
│ │ ↑ ↓        Scroll a page one line. j and k do the same.
│ │ PgUp PgDn  Scroll a page by its height less one line. b, f and space do the
│ │            same.
│ │ Home End   Go to the top or the end of a page. g and G do the same.
│ │ Esc, m     Go back to Main.
│ │ ?, h       Open this help. The same key on the help returns to Main.
│ │ l          Open the journal, which opens at its newest event and follows
│ │            new ones. The same key on the journal returns to Main.
│ │ scroll     A page opens at its top. Only a key changes the page or its
│ │            scroll, so a refresh never moves it. Main scrolls only on a
│ │            screen smaller than 160x45, where it shows numbers instead of
│ │            gauges.
│ │ q, Ctrl-C  Exit the dashboard; tuning itself keeps running.
